OL,3,GNEWSAArrest made as stop-search
OL,4,Aextended after stabbing
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn arrest has been made and stop and
OL,7,Fsearch powers further extended
OL,8,Ffollowing a fatal stabbing.
OL,10,FA man in his 30s died in hospital on
OL,11,FFriday after being found with stab
OL,12,Fwounds in Hodge Hill, Birmingham, on
OL,13,FTuesday. Police believe it was a
OL,14,Ftargeted attack.
OL,16,FWest Midlands Police extended its stop
OL,17,Fand search powers in the area for
OL,18,Fanother 24 hours on Saturday. Officers
OL,19,Frecovered two machetes and arrested a
OL,20,Fman after stopping a vehicle in
OL,21,FAdderley Road.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
