OL,3,GNEWSAArrest made as stop-search
OL,4,Aextended after stabbing
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Friday, four men were arrested and a
OL,7,Floaded revolver and machetes recovered.
OL,8,FPolice have not linked any of these
OL,9,Farrests to its murder investigation. A
OL,10,Fsection 60 order is now in place until
OL,11,F02:00 BST on Monday.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
